{"id":615,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と六年教育で学びを深める県立附属中学校","feature_description":"諫早高等学校附属中学校は、県立の中高一貫教育のもと、六年間を見通して確かな学力と主体性を育てます。日々の教科学習を土台に、探究や行事で課題に向き合い、仲間と対話しながら考えを深めます。自ら目標を定め、学習と学校生活の両面で努力を積み重ねる経験を通じて、地域と社会の未来を担うための思考力、表現力、協働する力を養います。未来につながる学びを進めます。","clubs":[{"id":15256,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/shared/uploads/2026/10/1792972801.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15257,"name":"テニス部男子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/shared/uploads/2026/10/1792972801.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15258,"name":"テニス部女子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/shared/uploads/2026/10/1792972801.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15259,"name":"バレーボール部男子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/shared/uploads/2026/10/1792972801.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15260,"name":"バレーボール部女子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/shared/uploads/2026/10/1792972801.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15261,"name":"バスケット部男子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/shared/uploads/2026/10/1792972801.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15262,"name":"バスケット部女子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/shared/uploads/2026/10/1792972801.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15263,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/shared/uploads/2026/10/1792972801.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15264,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/shared/uploads/2026/10/1792972801.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15265,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/shared/uploads/2026/10/1792972801.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15266,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/shared/uploads/2026/10/1792972801.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15267,"name":"吹奏楽部","cat